WEBVTT

00:03.180 --> 00:04.670
I'm here!

00:05.480 --> 00:07.800
Hey, wait!

00:08.280 --> 00:10.580
Wait, Hikari-chan!

00:10.780 --> 00:15.580
Hey! I told you to wait! Darn!

00:15.910 --> 00:17.910
Ah, a shell.

00:23.680 --> 00:24.800
What is this?

00:25.180 --> 00:26.610
A shell?

00:27.780 --> 00:30.190
I knew that...

00:30.480 --> 00:31.670
Could this be?

00:39.380 --> 00:40.520
Great!

00:44.580 --> 00:46.380
These are real pearls.

00:48.900 --> 00:52.510
Ah, this is the first time I've ever seen real pearls.

00:52.880 --> 00:55.120
It's really beautiful.

00:56.080 --> 00:58.430
What's so special about those beads?

00:58.980 --> 01:01.410
This is a girl's dream!

01:02.280 --> 01:03.480
Right?

01:05.190 --> 01:06.780
I don't understand.

01:06.880 --> 01:10.380
Okay, okay, let's forget this dreamless guy.

01:10.480 --> 01:11.860
What are we going to do with these pearls?

01:13.340 --> 01:15.280
Speaking of what we should do...

01:26.880 --> 01:27.480
I will say...

01:27.480 --> 01:29.710
I will pass, I don't know anything about them.

01:30.580 --> 01:34.530
Hikari-chan, you found those, so they should be yours.

01:34.780 --> 01:35.450
Right?

01:39.880 --> 01:41.310
That's true.

01:42.780 --> 01:44.840
At least I found these.

01:46.080 --> 01:49.350
Okay, I got it. These are mine now.

01:49.940 --> 01:51.970
Well, it's time for us to go back home.

01:52.280 --> 01:52.850
Yeah.

02:03.180 --> 02:08.170
Three People and Two Pearls

02:09.780 --> 02:11.410
Ah, it's so hot.

02:11.980 --> 02:17.150
Geez, it's really bad going home during the middle of the day after school.

02:17.780 --> 02:20.240
I'd rather have summer vacation start now.

02:20.280 --> 02:23.070
Ah? You don't like school?

02:23.100 --> 02:24.140
So boring...

02:24.860 --> 02:27.870
Ah, how much longer do I have to bear with this?

02:28.480 --> 02:33.380
Well, since today is Tuesday, the final ceremony will be...

02:33.450 --> 02:35.230
Today's Thursday, right?

02:35.580 --> 02:38.880
Well, anyways, I'm pretty stupid for asking that in the first place.

02:43.780 --> 02:45.670
That is...

02:45.880 --> 02:46.920
What's wrong?

03:06.780 --> 03:08.720
Yo, what are you doing there?

03:08.880 --> 03:12.850
Can't you see? I'm having fun during my summer vacation.

03:12.910 --> 03:14.790
Hey, aren't you hungry?

03:15.080 --> 03:17.420
How about going to my mom's store and getting something to eat?

03:17.980 --> 03:19.890
Hikari-chan, are you coming along with us?

03:21.580 --> 03:23.730
I'm not hungry, so I'll pass.

03:23.780 --> 03:27.130
That's so rare, you refusing someone's invitation for food.

03:27.180 --> 03:29.890
That's rude! I was looking out for you.

03:30.480 --> 03:32.460
Why not have the couple go ahead and have fun there?

03:32.470 --> 03:34.660
What? Hikari, how dare you!

03:36.670 --> 03:39.650
I hope you two will be happy!

03:40.680 --> 03:43.580
By the way, please clean up that rubber boat and parasol for me.

03:43.610 --> 03:44.860
What??

03:44.980 --> 03:46.440
Hey, Hikari!

03:47.210 --> 03:48.200
Geez...

03:48.880 --> 03:50.680
She seems weird.

03:51.180 --> 03:52.950
Isn't she always weird?

03:53.180 --> 03:55.260
It's not like that...

04:07.250 --> 04:11.960
Hey, Hikari, I put the rubber boat in the garage. You should be thanking me.

04:13.380 --> 04:15.020
Hikari, are you there?

04:15.280 --> 04:16.180
No, I'm not.

04:16.980 --> 04:18.010
Hey you...

04:29.780 --> 04:34.150
It seems like Hikari is doing something she doesn't want us to know about.

04:39.640 --> 04:43.810
Well, if it has nothing to do with me, I won't bother.

04:46.280 --> 04:47.350
Hikari-chan!

04:47.980 --> 04:49.630
Ah, Welcome.

04:51.480 --> 04:54.780
Nanami, I want to ask you for a favor.

04:56.480 --> 04:59.340
My, aren't you in a good mood?

04:59.380 --> 05:01.880
No, that's not true.

05:01.880 --> 05:06.510
Being ignored by your friends feels bad, huh?

05:11.280 --> 05:12.520
Thank you for having me.

05:17.770 --> 05:19.650
Huh? Where did I put it?

05:19.880 --> 05:21.090
What are you doing?

05:21.280 --> 05:25.390
Ah, it's you. Hey, did you see my pliers?

05:25.780 --> 05:27.290
Where did they go?

05:27.680 --> 05:29.330
Ah, pliers...

05:29.680 --> 05:31.550
Well, I didn't see them.

05:31.780 --> 05:34.430
Hey, did you really look for them?

05:34.430 --> 05:36.130
Hey... w-what the heck are you doing?

05:38.380 --> 05:39.290
How about it? It fits me well, right?

05:39.560 --> 05:43.180
What "fits me"? Where did you get that uniform anyway?

05:43.210 --> 05:44.650
I borrowed this from Nanami.

05:44.680 --> 05:46.630
What do you want?

05:46.680 --> 05:50.680
Isn't it obvious? I just want to go to your class.

05:50.720 --> 05:52.410
Huh? What did you say?

05:52.580 --> 05:56.480
Isn't that good? It'd be really interesting... I have a lot of free time anyway.

05:56.680 --> 06:01.420
Well, you can pretend that I'm the secret beauty who just transferred into your class.

06:01.460 --> 06:05.850
What pretend? First, this isn't allowed!

06:06.480 --> 06:09.090
Of course, we have an empty seat anyway.

06:11.480 --> 06:13.210
That's great, Hikari-chan.

06:14.980 --> 06:17.920
Thank you, everybody. Thanks!

06:18.980 --> 06:21.190
This is the reason why I call it a countryside school.

06:22.380 --> 06:24.890
Then from that, we can induce everything from above.

06:25.580 --> 06:27.800
Any questions about this part so far?

06:28.490 --> 06:30.240
Hmm, Hatano.

06:30.240 --> 06:32.680
Huh? I have no questions.

06:32.710 --> 06:34.630
Come on, don't pretend.

06:34.880 --> 06:36.450
There must be something you don't understand, right?

06:37.080 --> 06:40.790
D-Don't worry, thank you for your easy-to-understand lecture.

06:40.790 --> 06:43.430
All the students who failed the final...

06:43.580 --> 06:44.370
What is it?!

06:44.820 --> 06:47.040
Aren't you a bad student?

06:47.680 --> 06:50.090
Is that good? Sleeping during class?

06:50.180 --> 06:52.960
That's because you're here! Geez.

06:52.980 --> 06:55.090
Why did you sit right behind me?

06:55.120 --> 06:56.680
Are you always this annoyed?

06:56.880 --> 06:59.010
Ken-chan, we're still having class now.

06:59.280 --> 07:01.330
Quiet, I want to sleep.

07:12.780 --> 07:14.880
Jerk, cut it out!

07:25.260 --> 07:32.710
(Note: Sign says: "Teacher's room")

07:31.280 --> 07:32.960
Ah, he really "taught" me a lesson.

07:33.080 --> 07:35.180
That's all Ken-chan's fault.

07:35.180 --> 07:36.670
That's because Hikari...

07:43.880 --> 07:46.600
That girl... I have to get her!

07:46.780 --> 07:47.730
Ken-chan!

07:49.980 --> 07:51.910
He's so immature.

07:58.000 --> 07:59.570
That girl is reading a book?

07:59.780 --> 08:02.270
That's scary, she just might use a knife tomorrow.

08:02.380 --> 08:04.140
That's not true.

08:04.580 --> 08:07.140
But what is she reading?

08:07.180 --> 08:08.510
Hikari-chan!

08:09.780 --> 08:10.880
Hatano-kun?

08:10.880 --> 08:12.930
What? What? What are you reading?

08:13.380 --> 08:15.650
Ah, nothing, really...

08:15.680 --> 08:19.070
If possible, I can help you out. I'm free now.

08:19.180 --> 08:20.280
You don't have to.

08:20.580 --> 08:28.180
Well, this book isn't bad. Sweet lips get closer and closer to my face.

08:28.180 --> 08:30.770
Hey, let's play the "Connect the Word" game.

08:30.780 --> 08:32.110
Ah, that's a good idea.

08:32.480 --> 08:36.670
Ah, "Connect the Word." That's the game where you have to connect the first word to the next one.

08:37.380 --> 08:40.480
Let's spend this precious time between us now.

08:41.080 --> 08:44.140
 (TL Note: The "Connect the Word" game is where you take the last part of a word and say another word that starts with the same part.)

08:41.080 --> 08:44.140
Well let's start, first word is shiritori's ri.

08:44.500 --> 08:45.360
 (TL Note: Riru: scroll or reel.)

08:44.500 --> 08:45.360
Ri-ru.

08:46.210 --> 08:51.310
Ah, Hikari-chan is so amazing, there aren't that many words that start with 'ru'.

08:51.680 --> 08:52.800
 (TL Note: Rubi: Ruby.)

08:51.680 --> 08:52.800
Well, rubi!

08:53.180 --> 08:54.000
 (TL Note: Biru: Beer.)

08:53.180 --> 08:54.000
Bi-ru.

08:55.080 --> 08:56.060
 (TL Note: Rumania: Romania.)

08:55.080 --> 08:56.060
Ru-mania.

08:56.160 --> 08:56.980
 (TL Note: Ahiru: Duck.)

08:56.160 --> 08:56.980
Ahiru.

08:58.280 --> 08:58.990
Ruso.

08:58.280 --> 08:58.990
 (TL Note: Ruso: Pure water.)

08:59.180 --> 09:00.130
 (TL Note: Soru: Shoe sole.)

08:59.180 --> 09:00.130
So-ru.

09:01.480 --> 09:02.400
 (TL Note: Rujiana: Louisiana.)

09:01.480 --> 09:02.400
Ruijiana.

09:02.780 --> 09:04.260
Naichinge-ru.

09:02.780 --> 09:04.260
 (TL Note: Naichingeru: Nightingale.)

09:06.380 --> 09:09.910
You're still using... well... ru...

09:11.980 --> 09:12.840
Ru-to.

09:11.980 --> 09:12.840
 (TL Note: Ruto: Road.)

09:13.290 --> 09:14.260
Toropikaru.

09:13.290 --> 09:14.260
 (TL Note: Toropikaru: Tropical.)

09:15.380 --> 09:19.830
Not "ru" again... ru... ru... ru...

09:20.580 --> 09:21.360
 (TL Note: Ruru: Rule.)

09:20.580 --> 09:21.360
Ru-ru!

09:21.780 --> 09:22.570
Ru-buru

09:21.780 --> 09:22.570
 (TL Note: Ruburu: Rouoble, which is the Russian currency unit.)

09:23.980 --> 09:25.350
'Ru' again?

09:25.580 --> 09:28.640
Only she can come up with boring stuff like this.

09:31.680 --> 09:33.710
Excuse me, Tomosaka-senpai?

09:38.680 --> 09:41.220
Ru-ru-ru!!

09:43.990 --> 09:45.110
Sorry, Sakura-san.

09:45.880 --> 09:50.510
Well, do you come to this library often?

09:51.480 --> 09:55.080
Well, hmm, well... Hmm, sometimes...

09:55.180 --> 09:57.680
I don't think you've ever come here.

09:57.700 --> 10:01.890
Hey, Nanami, can't you be nicer?

10:01.980 --> 10:04.830
Ehhh, but I speak the truth.

10:04.880 --> 10:07.210
That's not the problem.

10:07.280 --> 10:08.800
Yes, ruiijinki's noodle...

10:09.680 --> 10:12.960
No, ruuiijinki's noodle's filling!

10:15.280 --> 10:16.780
Hatano, you lost.

10:16.960 --> 10:19.860
Well, as a punishment for losing the game, you can go ahead and return that book for me.

10:59.180 --> 11:00.530
That was so bad...

11:02.180 --> 11:05.670
Hey, Hikari, how come you're all soaked?

11:05.950 --> 11:08.530
This is called "watering beauty".

11:08.680 --> 11:11.080
Stop your nonsense. Hurry up and go take a shower.

11:11.080 --> 11:12.270
You'll get a cold.

11:12.480 --> 11:13.500
Okay, okay...

11:13.680 --> 11:15.730
Ah, even the hallway is wet.

11:16.080 --> 11:17.860
Geez, I don't know what to say to you.

11:19.980 --> 11:21.780
Hmm, a rag and a bucket.

11:40.630 --> 11:42.810
Is Hikari-chan still in her room?

11:42.850 --> 11:43.350
Yeah.

11:43.480 --> 11:47.880
What? I really want my revenge on that "word connection" game.

11:48.180 --> 11:49.700
Ah, Hikari-chan.

11:50.080 --> 11:53.090
Huh? What's wrong with you? Your face looks abnormally red.

11:53.330 --> 11:54.330
Really?

11:56.980 --> 11:59.300
Cold? Are you okay?

11:59.330 --> 12:01.430
See, I told you.

12:05.180 --> 12:09.670
Oh, yeah! At this time, the best treatment would be eating something that makes you sweat.

12:10.680 --> 12:13.220
Wait, are you going to cook?

12:13.250 --> 12:15.860
That's fine, just let her do it.

12:15.880 --> 12:18.780
But I really want to have some of Hikari-chan's dishes.

12:20.880 --> 12:22.790
Just don't regret it later.

12:23.780 --> 12:29.260
Okay this is Hikari's super special Vietnamese seafood soup!

12:30.280 --> 12:32.880
Wow, it looks so delicious!

12:32.880 --> 12:36.710
Isn't it Onii-chan's turn to make dinner tonight?

12:36.880 --> 12:39.400
Yeah, but there were many reasons...

12:40.040 --> 12:42.920
But she's really making an all-shell Vietnamese seafood soup.

12:42.950 --> 12:44.450
Don't be so picky.

12:44.780 --> 12:47.040
All right, please have as much as you want.

12:47.480 --> 12:49.720
Her cooking, her cooking!

12:50.080 --> 12:52.160
I'm eating now!

13:00.580 --> 13:02.100
Ah? You guys aren't eating?

13:10.880 --> 13:12.440
It's so hot.

13:14.560 --> 13:17.090
Oh Hatano-kun, You can't handle curry?

13:19.740 --> 13:22.700
No way, I'm completely fine with it!

13:22.970 --> 13:24.740
This spiciness is nothing.

13:24.920 --> 13:26.180
For real?

13:27.930 --> 13:29.320
Then I'll feed you.

13:29.710 --> 13:30.680
Really!?

13:32.450 --> 13:33.700
Here it comes...

13:40.500 --> 13:41.420
You don't want it?

13:45.270 --> 13:46.790
C'mon eat up!

13:46.880 --> 13:48.050
Eat lots and lots.

13:51.220 --> 13:52.240
How pitiful...

13:52.960 --> 13:55.510
Ah, that was so delicious.

13:55.780 --> 13:58.200
Hey, you should go ahead and lay down now.

13:58.540 --> 14:00.240
I know, I know...

14:02.120 --> 14:04.350
And you should go back home as soon as possible too.

14:11.550 --> 14:14.120
You're going to the beach again? Did you get any better?

14:14.380 --> 14:16.710
Don't worry, I'm fine now.

14:22.460 --> 14:24.540
You still have a fever.

14:24.720 --> 14:26.340
What are you doing there everyday? Huh?

14:26.620 --> 14:28.420
That's none of your business.

14:30.270 --> 14:33.040
Anyway, I can't let you go to the beach now.

14:33.340 --> 14:34.280
Go to sleep.

14:41.970 --> 14:44.250
Okay, okay, I know.

14:44.600 --> 14:47.080
I'll go to sleep, okay? Going to sleep...

14:52.100 --> 14:56.000
Even though you said that, I'll never give up on this!

15:06.420 --> 15:07.450
I found it, I found it!

15:37.810 --> 15:41.660
I didn't get a chance to play the "Connect the Word" game with her after all.

15:41.890 --> 15:43.310
I will have my revenge today for sure.

15:43.690 --> 15:45.300
You still want to play that?

15:46.950 --> 15:48.540
Huh? Isn't that Hikari-chan?

15:49.360 --> 15:53.130
It's really Hikari-chan. Hey, Hikari-chan!

15:55.930 --> 15:58.220
That moron, she's still sick.

16:16.230 --> 16:17.080
Nanami-chan!

16:29.050 --> 16:31.660
Help... me...

16:59.240 --> 17:00.290
Hey, Hikari...

17:03.180 --> 17:05.430
You're sick and still doing this crazy stuff?

17:09.330 --> 17:12.290
But thank goodness you were so close just now.

17:16.250 --> 17:17.980
You're looking for pearls, right?

17:20.900 --> 17:23.130
Don't make me worry about you all the time, okay?

17:32.340 --> 17:35.290
Actually, I really wanted to share those between the three of us.

17:35.900 --> 17:40.910
But... but there were only two pearls.

17:43.110 --> 17:48.950
And I can't afford a pearl either. So, I wanted to find another one.

17:49.680 --> 17:51.620
Even though I know I may have been childish...

17:52.320 --> 17:54.450
But I couldn't find any...

17:55.960 --> 17:58.150
I really wanted to share those between the three of us.

17:59.790 --> 18:03.500
However, only I have them.

18:04.280 --> 18:06.260
Why didn't you just say it?

18:06.720 --> 18:08.810
I wanted to give you a surprise.

18:09.290 --> 18:11.920
But I only created trouble...

18:12.460 --> 18:15.180
Sorry, I'm truly sorry.

18:24.260 --> 18:25.700
Seems like I got no other choice.

18:27.050 --> 18:28.990
Take care, Ken-chan.

19:07.400 --> 19:13.030
It hurts... this octopus! I can't stay up anymore!

19:27.020 --> 19:27.770
Here it is!

19:28.090 --> 19:29.460
Good job, Hikari-chan!

19:30.510 --> 19:31.650
Let me see, let me see.

19:38.700 --> 19:43.190
Hey, Hikari-chan, can I have this one?

19:54.580 --> 19:56.910
Okay, you two put out your hands.

19:58.980 --> 20:00.540
These are yours.

20:05.130 --> 20:06.680
Thank you, Hikari-chan.

20:07.200 --> 20:08.410
Thanks, Hikari.

20:09.750 --> 20:13.760
Don't be mistaken, mine's the biggest.

20:14.120 --> 20:17.960
What was that? You ruined the whole story.

20:18.040 --> 20:19.980
What? You got a problem with that?

20:22.780 --> 20:25.910
But, Ken-chan, look, this is really beautiful.

20:26.790 --> 20:27.670
Yeah.

20:33.860 --> 20:36.950
Okay, Hatano, we can leave now. We're disturbing them.

20:37.150 --> 20:39.570
This couple will get mad at us.

20:39.890 --> 20:41.490
Yeah, Hikari-chan.

20:42.560 --> 20:43.710
Hikari, how dare you...

20:43.780 --> 20:45.790
What? Wasn't it true?

20:45.980 --> 20:46.990
Ah, Hikari-chan!

20:47.330 --> 20:49.310
This isn't the problem!

20:50.480 --> 20:53.610
Ah, wait for me, everybody!

21:05.280 --> 21:08.900
Hey, Hikari-chan, isn't my uniform too big for you?

21:09.150 --> 21:10.880
It's too loose for me at the chest.

21:11.300 --> 21:12.020
Well...

21:12.140 --> 21:14.000
And the hip area is loose too.

21:14.290 --> 21:15.250
Well...

21:15.490 --> 21:17.120
And the waist is too tight for me.

21:17.510 --> 21:18.550
Well...

21:18.610 --> 21:19.450
Nanami...

21:19.610 --> 21:20.840
Y-Yes?

21:21.040 --> 21:23.160
Give me my pearl back.

21:23.600 --> 21:24.700
Next on Lamune:

21:25.110 --> 21:26.950
Bike Girl and the Part-time Job

21:27.390 --> 21:30.730
Ah, Hikari-chan is giving me a hard time!

21:29.150 --> 21:34.000
Thanks to the following:
Ripper: TCT66; Original Timer: nanaya; Original Typesetter: kiasushou; Original Chinese Subs for Extra Scenes: Fino; English Subs: C1Anime

21:31.030 --> 21:34.000
Nanami, that is not your fault.
